# L2-WRT-022: the same tie as tie-canonical-order, decoded with
# --max-sort-group 1. A cap of 1 makes every record its own run, so no
# reordering happens and the oracle is raw DDC capture order -- the documented
# escape hatch for a byte-for-byte vendor-CSV diff.

